{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10124430","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10124430","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1012443001:0":{"text":"美しい花畑を見ていると、三百歳ほど若返った気分になるのう。ここで皆に詩を一句聞かせてやりたいところじゃが……","source_cn":"望着这片美丽的花海，我仿佛一下子年轻了三百多岁，甚至想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83A1F1C2D460EFA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012443002:0":{"text":"今はまだその時ではないな。ブライアン、空を見よ、エルーナが来たぞ。","source_cn":"不过……还不是时候啊。布莱恩，看向天空吧，艾洛娜来找你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x911AF907945688B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012443003:1":{"text":"ピィーー！","source_cn":"叽——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B313E1EE1C71B63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012443004:1":{"text":"エルーナ！？ルナーランドに残れと言ったのに、ここへ来たということは、まさか……","source_cn":"艾洛娜？！我让她留在月影乡，她飞到这里，难道是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2859D59AC8956A7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012443005:2":{"text":"ピィー！","source_cn":"叽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE94ED88674F13CAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title